            <valueName>layer:SOREM:1.0:Broadcast_Text</valueName>
            <value>At 5:59 p.m. Central Daylight Time Saturday, Environment Canada has ended a marine tornado warning for Manitoba Lakes Manitoba.  Lake Winnipegosis. Environment Canada meteorologists are tracking a severe thunderstorm that is possibly producing a tornado. Damaging winds, large hail and locally intense rainfall are also possible. </value>
